WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:01.950
- One of the world's worst attorneys

00:00:01.950 --> 00:00:03.800
has finally been sanctioned.

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:05.970
Stephen Biss, who has
often represented people

00:00:05.970 --> 00:00:09.430
like Devin Nunes was representing
one Devin Nunes as aids,

00:00:09.430 --> 00:00:12.970
Derek Harvey in a
defamation suit against CNN.

00:00:12.970 --> 00:00:15.310
Lo and behold, the judge
tossed the defamation suit

00:00:15.310 --> 00:00:17.300
because it was complete nonsense

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:19.210
and actually sanctioned the lawyer,

00:00:19.210 --> 00:00:21.760
Steven Biss for his repeated misconduct

00:00:21.760 --> 00:00:25.710
and actually awarded CNN
attorney's fees over $20,000.

00:00:25.710 --> 00:00:28.560
So at least in this instance,
we won't see them in court.

